# third pass: through the prologue's text into the first battle, cursor and menu, pause, hotkeys
wait 240
mash START 6 40
mash A 120 40
shot prologue
mash A 60 40
shot battle
hold RIGHT 30
press A 4
wait 60
shot cursor
press B 4
wait 30
press HOME 6
wait 30
shot homemenu
press HOME 6
wait 30
press HOME+Y 6
wait 20
shot swapped
press HOME+Y 6
wait 20
shot back
# save / load (HOME+R, move, HOME+L)
press HOME+R 6
hold RIGHT 60
shot moved
press HOME+L 6
wait 10
shot loaded
# added by the 3DS check: get past the rest of the prologue's text onto the first turn, then the cursor on a unit
mash A 60 40
wait 120
shot turn1
mash A 40 40
wait 120
shot turn2
hold DOWN 20
wait 40
shot cursor2
